<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah explosives seized in two Lebanese trucks have led Lebanon's prime minister and security forces to promise thorough investigations. In northern Israel, Hezbollah submunitions exploded in a teenager's backpack during a hike near the Lebanon border, killing the teen and wounding dozens, prompting the IDF chief to order a probe and authorities to consider restricting hikes. Israeli artillery and air strikes continue against Hezbollah positions in southern Lebanon, causing civilian casualties. The conflict has produced 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNSlJMdlFZMmhIem5Nc0lSOHluTVVDWUl1bTFSOTJIeHlWX2NIQW5JYkcybDhzV01LNGNxaEVWWElwMnZtY1lfSnJFYXpWUThySnhuQ0dETVFxMVE5UkpJLWlUUVdDOFkwQnVhRXNhTE1VTlZSNE9yWVI4cFBvZUF6eTZ5dV9BLWdHeklyMWp5dUMzWXZhWTlhNF9QdWpWSlJpSTJGNWNQWVJXV2pVUlJQaXlnY3k1UU1EdzRiRm04RmhxSGZ6aHJUNzJrdHBiZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOQzJBNlJyQlp1RVhtYTVmN0xiNnVEdVdIYW90MDI4Y2JJNVI3clF2N0F0ZEFUbW1FcXBjTUUwTUdKdWY4ZzFTZmE2MjQtN0I2WERkQkRSd1ZPMUhrTnlJcGMtNHJBRnNVMEtYNXlnY0ZoX0JpMkRRekV4OTRlQklrc0FxdzRlOVVwQmJ0VEhWbk02eTRrbTZxU2lyUGxkVU9JcFoyR2N6OV9YTzlQSEZSWU5oRTZ5eDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=